@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+category: Bugfix
+authors: [agent]
+---
+
+Daily schedules with weekend skipping now skip Saturday and Sunday occurrences instead of moving them onto the neighbouring Friday or Monday, so they no longer fall on the same day twice or before their start date
